## Conversion to Apache License 2.0

Two years after the date a given version of the software was first published,
that version is additionally available to you under the Apache License, Version
2.0, at your option, with no further action required by the licensor.

Conversion applies per version, measured from that version's own publication
date. Later versions remain under this license until their own two years elapse.
Once a version has converted, the conversion is irrevocable for that version.

## Enforcement

Compliance with this license is a contractual matter between you and the
